      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A JUNO Award winning alternative-country singer-songwriter from Toronto with 7 albums to his credit. Justin's latest release ‘East’ was recorded in Nova Scotia with producer Daniel Ledwell (Jenn Grant).&nbsp; Rutledge has toured Canada, the UK, the United States and Europe, and has played shows"
